Sita addresses departing husband with affection --- Sita names three lust-born vices including causeless cruelty --- Sita recalls Rama's vow to slay Dandaka rakshasas --- Sita fears bow-in-hand Rama will spend arrows --- Sita tells ascetic entrusted with deposited sword --- Sword-bearing turned ascetic cruel and hell-bound --- Sita bids bow serve only guarding distressed --- Sita urges dharma and return to kshatra ways